guide forever/reputation/alterac-valley
title Alterac Valley Reputation
category Reputation
folder Reputation · Battlegrounds
levels 51-60
zone Alterac Mountains
keywords Stormpike Guard, Frostwolf Clan, Alterac Valley, Lieutenant Haggerdin, Warmaster Laggrond, Stormpike Insignia, Frostwolf Insignia, Armor Scraps, Murgot Deepforge, Smith Regzar, Thanthaldis Snowgleam, Jekyll Flandring, Alterac Valley Mark of Honor, Stormpike Battle Charger, Horn of the Frostwolf Howler, Master of Alterac Valley, Legacy Point
reward text Master of Alterac Valley: a Legacy Point at Exalted
reward item 17904 "Stormpike Insignia Rank 6"
reward item 17909 "Frostwolf Insignia Rank 6"
reward item 19032
reward item 19031
